{"duration_api_ms":46894,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3d9120d3-16e4-4cd2-8af1-3f6335bf130e","total_cost_usd":0.38047400000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34173,"cache_read_input_tokens":147710,"output_tokens":3875,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":767},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34173,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":759,"cache_read_input_tokens":38146,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2007,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2007},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":3875,"cacheReadInputTokens":147710,"cacheCreationInputTokens":34173,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.38047400000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":767,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":7,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The judge verdict for CAT-03 is **pass**: each of the four tests proves its scenario, with no confirmed defects. I wrote the verdict to `tasks/CAT-03/judge.md`.\n\nCAT-03 is an adopted story, so nothing was built and the only check is whether each test does what its scenario says:\n- **Not-found page content:** the browser test opens `/products/no-such-product` and checks \"404\", the heading \"Page Not Found\" and the full message.\n- **Tab title:** the integration test checks that the page title is exactly \"domaincentric.commerce\".\n- **\"Browse All Products\" and \"Go to Homepage\":** the integration tests check each link's label, then open the page it points to and check that page's heading (\"Our Products\" and \"Welcome to domaincentric.commerce\").\n\nI raised a few points and dropped them as not defects:\n- **Integration tests instead of the browser:** three scenarios are checked by reading the rendered HTML. That's acceptable because only the first scenario is the story's happy path, and that one runs in the browser.\n- **Link matching is fragile:** the pattern that finds a link needs `href` to come before `data-test`. The template renders them in that order today, and the test fails loudly if that changes.\n- **Missing `data-test` attributes:** the page's \"404\", heading and message have no `data-test` attribute, although `project/product.md` asks for one on every element a test addresses. The browser test finds them by CSS class instead. That's a gap in the page markup, which an adopted story doesn't change; the plan already records it, so it could be a later story.\n- **No status check:** the tests don't check the HTTP status, because no scenario names one. The page currently returns 200.\n\nThe ddd, hexagonal and clean-code reviews ran in this session rather than through their review skills, since there was no model or adapter change to review. The extra `dca` review was not covered because there's no production code.\n\nThe startup message said a factory worker was already running CAT-03 and there is a `judge.110006.out` file, so the pipeline may be running its own judge stage. If it is, it may overwrite this `judge.md`.","ttft_ms":2818,"type":"result","duration_ms":47182,"uuid":"2d1d85a3-2b22-4c07-8fac-2c0314b88e23","ttft_stream_ms":1629,"time_to_request_ms":34,"first_content_frame_ms":1630,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
